libfprint-egis0576-tod (0.4.4-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Ubuntu TOD module packaging. Builds the egis0576 driver as a
    standalone libfprint-2/tod-1 module against the stock Ubuntu
    libfprint-2-tod-dev headers. Does not replace libfprint-2-2.
  * Build on the oldest supported series (noble): the TOD version script's
    newest node carries a symbol catch-all, so a module built on a newer
    series can fail to load on an older one. See packaging/README.md.

